  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 点到平面距离",
    "title": "长方体 $ABCD$-$A_1B_1C_1D_1$ 中，$AB=3$，$BC=1$，$AA_1=2$，$M$ 为 $A_1B_1$ 的中点。点 $N$ 是长方体表面上一点，满足 $NB=NM=ND$，则 $N$ 到平面 $ABCD$ 的距离为",
    "answerLabel": "$N$ 到平面 $ABCD$ 的距离",
    "answers": [
      {
        "label": "$N$ 在侧面 $ABB_1A_1$",
        "value": "$\\dfrac{5}{16}$"
      },
      {
        "label": "$N$ 在侧面 $DCC_1D_1$",
        "value": "$\\dfrac{9}{16}$"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "建系",
      "content": "<p>以 $A$ 为原点，$AB$、$AD$、$AA_1$ 为 $x$、$y$、$z$ 轴：</p>$$A(0,0,0),\\ B(3,0,0),\\ D(0,1,0),\\ A_1(0,0,2).$$<p>$M$ 为 $A_1B_1$ 中点，故 $M(\\dfrac{3}{2}, 0, 2)$。平面 $ABCD$ 即 $z=0$，所求就是 $N$ 的竖坐标。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Plane_ABCD",
        "Len_AB",
        "Len_BC",
        "Len_AA1",
        "Point_M",
        "Line_A1B1"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 8.46,
        "y": 5.91,
        "z": 5.92
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "$NB=NM=ND$ 化为垂直平分面",
      "content": "<p>$N$ 到 $B$、$M$ 等距，故 $N$ 在线段 $BM$ 的垂直平分面上；到 $B$、$D$ 等距，故 $N$ 在 $BD$ 的垂直平分面上。</p><p>设 $N=(x,y,z)$，由 $|N-B|^2=|N-M|^2$ 与 $|N-B|^2=|N-D|^2$ 得</p>$$12x-16z=11,\\qquad 3x-y=4.$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_M",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_D",
        "Line_BM",
        "Line_BD",
        "Plane_perpBM",
        "Plane_perpBD"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 10.1,
        "y": 5.43,
        "z": 3.62
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "情形一：$N$ 在侧面 $ABB_1A_1$",
      "content": "<p>在 $y=0$ 上联立 $12x-16z=11$、$3x=4$，得</p>$$N_1\\left(\\dfrac{4}{3},0,\\dfrac{5}{16}\\right).$$<p>它落在矩形 $ABB_1A_1$ 内部。到地面 $ABCD$（$z=0$）的距离就是竖坐标 $\\dfrac{5}{16}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_N",
        "Plane_ABB1A1",
        "Plane_ABCD",
        "Line_BN",
        "Line_MN",
        "Line_DN",
        "Point_M",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_D"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 10.1,
        "y": 4.47,
        "z": 4.58
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "情形二：$N$ 在侧面 $DCC_1D_1$",
      "content": "<p>在 $y=1$ 上联立得</p>$$N_2\\left(\\dfrac{5}{3},1,\\dfrac{9}{16}\\right).$$<p>它落在矩形 $DCC_1D_1$ 内部，到地面距离为 $\\dfrac{9}{16}$。其它四个面无解或超出边界。因此距离为 $\\dfrac{5}{16}$ 或 $\\dfrac{9}{16}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_N2",
        "Plane_DCC1D1",
        "Plane_ABCD",
        "Line_BN2",
        "Line_MN2",
        "Line_DN2",
        "Point_M",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_D"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 6.44,
        "y": 8.65,
        "z": 4.77
      }
    }
